WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.830
Night in Raveloe.

2
00:00:01.880 --> 00:00:04.950
A stone cottage, shutters closed.

3
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.440
Inside, a bent figure works at a loom.

4
00:00:08.490 --> 00:00:12.430
Every evening, he stacks
gold coins into towers.

5
00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:18.090
"He seemed to weave, like the spider,
from pure impulse, without reflection."

6
00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:21.220
Year after year, the shutters stay shut.

7
00:00:21.270 --> 00:00:22.910
Nobody comes in.

8
00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:26.830
Then, one snowy night,
the door stands open.

9
00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:31.060
So what turns a man who loved
only gold towards people?

10
00:00:31.110 --> 00:00:36.520
In this mission, you'll see how his whole
life shrank to "weaving and hoarding".

11
00:00:36.570 --> 00:00:40.980
You'll go back to where it began: a
friend's betrayal in Lantern Yard.

12
00:00:41.030 --> 00:00:44.470
And you'll follow his
change, stage by stage.

13
00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:48.600
Your mission: explain what
turns him from gold to people.
